'''Memory Erasure''', also known as the '''Seal of Obliviation''',{{Ref|m|73|19}} is a type of [[Spells|spell]] mostly used by the [[Knights Moralis]] to wipe the knowledge of [[Forbidden Magic|forbidden magic]] from their targets.

==Description==
Unlike most spells, the memory erasure seals are white on a black background instead of drawn with ink on a regular surface. Several variants of the spell have been seen, though all are incredibly similar with only minor additions such as additional signs that set them apart. The sigil at the center is made of concentric circles with a dot in the middle. Several [[Magic#Glaives|glaives]]{{Ref|m|63|3}} also protrude from the bottom of the spell, and the circle also contains dot-shaped signs along the outer edge and top.

Regarding the spell variants, these effects have been seen and/or suggested:{{Ref|m|80|7}}
* Total erasure of magic from the mind, and any memories connected to it.{{Ref|m|56|22}}{{Ref|m|57|7}}
* Erasure from a specific period of time.{{Ref|m|49|26}}
* Erasure of specific topics{{Ref|m|40|19}} or people,{{Ref|m|54|13}} regardless of time.

[[File:Memory erasure effect.jpg|left|thumb|250px|The spell used by Easthies, almost erasing Coco's memory]]
During the [[River Rescue Arc]], [[Easthies|Easthies']] spell can be seen growing short protrusions and reaching for [[Coco's]] face, almost as if it were alive.{{Ref|m|11|26}}

